# Artificial Evolution changes Juggernaut’s Wall restriction to Bear; a Wall can block while a Bear cannot (CR 612.1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Artificial Evolution
Juggernaut
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Grizzly Bears
Wall of Wood
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Juggernaut.Cast
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Artificial Evolution.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Juggernaut)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(Wall)
Bot1.Modes(Bear)
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot2.Hand.Grizzly Bears.Cast
Bot2.Hand.Wall of Wood.Cast
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
! Bot1.Attack()
Bot1.Attack(Juggernaut > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Grizzly Bears > Juggernaut)
Bot2.Block(Wall of Wood > Juggernaut)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Juggernaut.Damage = 0
Bot2.Graveyard = Wall of Wood; Black Lotus
Bot2.Life = 20
